# Events for the hammer-ons-recalc configuration (configurations.txt), played with the "play"
# recording instead of play.events. microLinn recalculates its settings every 250 ms while hammer-ons
# are played, as it does on a memory load, an import, NRPN 1300, or the previous-scale footswitch with
# condensed bends. That includes the hammer-on zone and the list of muted notes, so muted notes are held
# across it. NRPN 1300 asks for it; NRPNs other than 299 need importing on.

